; names for /bin/upm off the Micronix 1.6 standalone, for src/tools/disas
;
;   disas -f upm.ctl upm
;
; upm is CP/M for Micronix: the BDOS emulation, a CCP, and the syscall
; layer that lets a CP/M program think it is on a CP/M disk.  The names
; come from upm's own .mx symbol table, unlike init's, which is stripped.
;
